  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Risk Mitigation and Management of Human Health Threats  Along Animal Value Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to collect longitudinal data and information along value chains at the livestock-wildlife-human interface that improves inter-sectoral collaboration and minimizes impacts of diseases to animals and people. This project will contribute significantly to mitigating and managing the impacts of zoonotic health threats in Viet Nam.</narrative>
  </description>
